@apiUrl = http://localhost:4000/api/v1
# Run auth/login once per role and paste response access tokens into local variables.

### Public catalogue (200)
GET {{apiUrl}}/products

### Anonymous request to a private endpoint (401)
GET {{apiUrl}}/users/me

### Customer can see own profile (200)
GET {{apiUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Customer cannot access staff orders (403)
GET {{apiUrl}}/admin/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### Manager can process orders (200)
GET {{apiUrl}}/admin/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### Manager cannot manage users (403)
GET {{apiUrl}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### Admin can manage users (200)
GET {{apiUrl}}/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
